jt-pve-storage-purestorage (1.1.20-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * [MEDIUM] Override get_identity(), added to the base
    PVE::Storage::Plugin in Proxmox VE 9.2 (base default die()s with
    "get_identity not implemented for this plugin"). It is invoked via
    the new GET /nodes/<node>/storage/<storage>/identity endpoint
    (primarily for Proxmox Backup Server instance matching; the Web UI
    may poll it for any storage), so without the override the base
    die() surfaces as a Web UI error on PVE 9.2. Returns a
