    - Fix _find_free_diskid to strip pod prefix before decode_volume_name
    - Fix pve-pure-config-get restore mode: boolean logic on line 94
      was always dying in restore mode
    - Fix pve-pure-config-get san_storage to use sanitize_for_pure
